  description: 'V5 (visual prefabs): 0:00: Deck Cannons, Flamethrower and Powder
    Kegs at rank 4 with Devil''s Match, Queen Anne''s Fuse, Storm in a Bottle, Leviathan
    Heart and the Hammerhead Helm, among weak sharks (kills), sturdy cannonboats
    (enemy shots and splashes), bomb boats (enemy blasts) and a kraken spawn: hit
    sparks, crits, kill bursts, elite kill, explosions, splashes, damage numbers,
    burn flashes and the item procs. Every visual is a prefab under Assets/_Game/V4/Visuals/Prefabs/<Category>/<id>/
    (plan/v5/VISUAL-PREFABS.md): edit one, then load this again from the Tuning Console.'
